  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "`for t in times:` içinde önce `queue.append(t)`.",
      "en": "Inside `for t in times:`, first `queue.append(t)`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "`while queue[0] <= t - window: queue.popleft()`, sonra `counts.append(len(queue))`.",
      "en": "`while queue[0] <= t - window: queue.popleft()`, then `counts.append(len(queue))`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nfrom collections import deque\n\n\ndef recent_counts(times, window):\n    queue = deque()\n    counts = []\n    for t in times:\n        queue.append(t)\n        while queue[0] <= t - window:\n            queue.popleft()\n        counts.append(len(queue))\n    return counts\n\n\nprint(recent_counts([1, 2, 5, 12, 13], 10))\nprint(recent_counts([], 10))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nfrom collections import deque\n\n\ndef recent_counts(times, window):\n    queue = deque()\n    counts = []\n    for t in times:\n        queue.append(t)\n        while queue[0] <= t - window:\n            queue.popleft()\n        counts.append(len(queue))\n    return counts\n\n\nprint(recent_counts([1, 2, 5, 12, 13], 10))\nprint(recent_counts([], 10))\n```"
    }
  ],
